Original commit body from 7cbf5a7:

Add verbose source code viewing capabilities:

- explain --verbose (-v): Shows source code for queried symbol, callers,
  and callees. Module-level calls show only the single call line.
  Supports -t/--tokens budget to limit output.

- sketch --with-source: Appends full source file contents after the
  regular sketch, ordered by symbol importance density. Respects
  token budget.

Also updates 5W1H semantic probes with detailed descriptions for
improved "Additional Files" ranking in sketch output.
